  wrongExp: "• <strong>Option A (24%):</strong> This incorrectly uses the case count as the percentage without dividing by the number exposed.<br>• <strong>Option C (60%):</strong> This is the number exposed expressed as a percentage of itself, not the proportion who became ill.<br>• <strong>Option D (84%):</strong> This has no basis in the attack-rate calculation."
